            "content": "<p><strong>This isn’t your average hair brush.</strong> We reimagined the haircare staple to be functional, reliable and timeless. The Detangling Brush painlessly detangles hair while preventing breakage, static, and frizz.</p><p>This brush can be used on wet or dry hair and features a <strong>drainage hole</strong> to avoid water retention and damage. Metal bristles gently exfoliate the scalp which promotes hair growth, removes build up, and adds shine.</p><p><em>The Detangling Brush is safe to use on all hair types and extensions.</em></p>"
